From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:48:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msm8996-common: Ims4 reaches SIP REGISTER -- compat layer for
 removed telephony APIs, faithful LG enums, VoPS push

compat-java/ (compiled against the system stubs, merged into the apk):
- TelephonyCompat: static stand-ins for the removed TelephonyManager @hide
  methods Ims4 calls (getPcscfAddress* from the IMS network's LinkProperties,
  getIsim*ForSubscriber, getIsimChallengeResponse*), isLocationProviderEnabled
  ForUser, and an in-process publisher of LG's sticky ISIM_STATE_CHANGED
  (LGImsIsimHandler is absent, SIMStateAgent sat in SUBSCRIBERINCOMPLETED).
- ImsPhoneCompat: in-process IIMSPhone stand-in (com.lge.ims.phone is not a
  service here). Pushes VoPS to the engine the way LG RIL did: sticky
  lge.intent.action.LTE_NETWORK_SUPPORTED_INFO with int VoPS_Support/
  EPDN_Support from the PS WWAN NetworkRegistrationInfo's VopsSupportInfo.
  Holds a strong ref to its TelephonyCallback (the registry only weak-refs it;
  an unreferenced listener is GC'd and updates silently stop) and LATCHES VoPS
  while PS stays registered on LTE: qcrild reports isVopsSupported=false on
  every LTE_CA (rat 19) data-registration response, which flickered 2/3/2/3
  around data activity and aborted REGISTER mid-flight.
method-redirects.txt: the redirects above, setCellInfoListRate/
notifyVoLteServiceStateChanged dropped, IIMSPhone$Stub.asInterface ->
ImsPhoneCompat. smali-fixups.py: start the ISIM monitor from SIMStateAgent.
extra-smali: LGPhoneConstants$LteStateInfo, LGDataPhoneConstants$LteStateInfo
and $VolteAndEPDNSupport are faithful copies of the stock enums (names, codes,
fromInt by code): the verify stubs returned one code for every constant, so
"APN is blocked" and VoPS never cleared.
build-ims4.sh: compile compat-java, merge com/lge/ims/compat, apply redirects
with apply-method-redirects.py.

Result on T-Mobile: IMS PDN up, VoPS true, REGISTER with Security-Client sent,
401 AKAv1-MD5 challenge received. The IPsec helpers are the next commit.

---
 ims/build-ims4.sh                             |  15 +-
 .../android/internal/telephony/IIMSPhone.java |  14 +
 .../internal/telephony/ISysMonitor.java       |   7 +
 .../com/lge/ims/compat/ImsPhoneCompat.java    | 207 +++++++++++++++
 .../com/lge/ims/compat/TelephonyCompat.java   | 207 +++++++++++++++
 .../LGPhoneConstants$LteStateInfo.smali       | 156 ++++++++++--
 .../LGDataPhoneConstants$LteStateInfo.smali   | 165 +++++++++++-
 ...taPhoneConstants$VolteAndEPDNSupport.smali | 241 +++++++++++++++++-
 ims/method-redirects.txt                      |  25 ++
 ims/smali-fixups.py                           |  20 +-
 10 files changed, 1003 insertions(+), 54 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ims/compat-java/com/android/internal/telephony/IIMSPhone.java
 create mode 100644 ims/compat-java/com/android/internal/telephony/ISysMonitor.java
